GFOpenTorrent: PicoTorrent on one task. A bsdsocket.library base belongs to
the task that opened it, so the session runs on the program's own
io_context (no network thread), with posix disk I/O and no hashing or disk
threads; main() runs wxEntry inside that io_context, a wx timer polls it
while the UI waits, and saving at the end polls for alerts instead of
waiting (compat/gfot_loop.cpp). Under __WXOPENLAYOUT__, Windows' code as
it was.
